{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/24161-looking-for-a-online-mage-the-awakening-game","id":24161,"title":"Looking for a online Mage The Awakening game.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-05T20:55:19-08:00","id":24161,"title":"Looking for a online Mage The Awakening game.","content":"Hey everyone Nice to see the new website I miss old one kind of but nice to see the new one also. Well its me Basic204 being we are on this new site I put my self down as Basic. So anyway. I am looking for a new world of darkness Mage the Awakening game. I have been reading the books for some time but have yet to ever find a game to play in. I really love the idea of mage and find it very interesting. If anyone has free slot let me know by messaging me on here. Thanks again. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T11:55:20-08:00","id":25273,"title":"","content":"Hey Basic. If you're looking for a Mage game, I recommend <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/12081-laceratus-pratorum-ongoing-mage-noir-game-looking-for-players\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ng-for-players</a>.<br /> <br /> The game is a 1940s-50s noir style set in a fictional city that is basically Vegas. Pretty much anything you need to know is in the topic. I'm one of the players in this game as Sors, Acanthus Free Council mage-gambler. We also have a Moros Guardian, and no one else. Just follow the instructions on the forum to offer a character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1108-wolffan","name":"wolffan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T07:07:19-08:00","id":25777,"title":"","content":"I only know a few places, and they're MUSHes.<br /> <br /> The Reach (Aleswich (fictional city), Maine, USA): <a href=\"http://thereachmux.org/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://thereachmux.org/wiki/Main_Page</a><br /> Haunted Memories (Vienna, Austria): <a href=\"http://www.haunted-memories.net/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.haunted-memories.net/wiki/Main_Page</a><br /> The Great Game (London, England): <a href=\"http://thegreatgamemux.com/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://thegreatgamemux.com/wiki/Main_Page</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Shok ebasit hissra. Meraad astaarit, meraad itwasit, aban aqun. Maraas shokra. Anaan esaam Qun.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/710-veddhartha","name":"Veddhartha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar710_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T19:59:08-08:00","id":28484,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://z13.invisionfree.com/Clash_of_Powers\" target=\"_blank\">Clash of Powers</a> is looking for players/ a storyteller <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1641-jamesbrennan","name":"jamesbrennan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T23:08:32-08:00","id":34321,"title":"","content":"Check out Revelations MUX: <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Revelations MUX is a Mage: the Awakening, supernatural roleplaying MUX set in Edinburgh, Scotland. It's 2011 and the city is having issues: drug use is rampant, violent crimes are on the rise, and society stumbles over one scandal after another. Just when it seems things can't get any worse, the mages of Scotland face a rising crisis that threatens to end three centuries of peace and prosperity.<br /> <br /> Formidable supernatural defenses protecting the mystical heart of Britain are falling. Strange things lurk in the night: monsters no longer held in check by protective wards hunt down mortals and mages alike in the medieval streets. Restless dead stalk the city's ancient, haunted underground. Forgotten treasures are surfacing after centuries. The greatest magical prize in Europe is up for grabs. <br /> <br /> When mages go to war, no one wins. Only Scotland's oldest and most powerful allies and enemies can take the truest measure of these deadly menaces and divine the future of an ancient city.</span></span></span><br /> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b><a href=\"http://www.revelationsmux.net/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.revelationsmux.net/</a> </b><br /> <b>tex-mux.mmlx.us port 8888</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> </div> Looking for new Players, friendly community.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1766-veritasr","name":"VeritasR","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T09:21:23-08:00","id":34471,"title":"","content":"I'm really looking for a game over skype or IRC because play by post takes forever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-17T23:33:28-07:00","id":594482,"title":"","content":"I'm looking for mage awakening game to join. I have played all of the world of darkness games so I know all the rules","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6974-shaggy727","name":"Shaggy727","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T02:09:48-07:00","id":594594,"title":"","content":"You should post this at <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings\">conventions and gathering forum</a>.<br /> <br /> The only ongoing play-by-post mta game that I know of is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392070-ooc-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-campaign-set-in-2009\">this one</a> (btw, I am a player).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T10:03:59-07:00","id":594818,"title":"","content":"Once 2nd Edition becomes available and I have a chance to read through the rules portions at a minimum, I'll be doing MtAw 2e on Roll20. Since that's going to be an indeterminate time from now I'm not posting or recruiting for it just yet. <br /> <br /> I had been planning to run a game for almost a year now, but my IRL group of about five years broke up recently. So I'm currently learning the Roll20 ropes playing in a Burning Wheel game, while I plan out what I'm going to do with Mage based on all the existing stuff and Dave's spoilers/previews. <br /> <br /> Since it will be a new edition with some relatively big changes, I'm going to start with a small sandbox and then work my way up to a larger scale setting. Then when I'm no longer learning and teaching the game quite as much things might be more free-form.<br /> <br /> But you might want to look at Roll20 for something more current. Unfortunately, Roll20's game searches are based on a pre-defined dropdown and they lump all of the WoD games (old and new) into one option, so you might need to slog through a lot of listings for things you don't want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2205-abaddon","name":"Abaddon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T07:59:07-07:00","id":962288,"title":"","content":"Hey guys!<br /> <br /> Although this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daimon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/24161-looking-for-a-online-mage-the-awakening-game?p=594594#post594594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You should post this at <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings\">conventions and gathering forum</a>.<br /> <br /> The only ongoing play-by-post mta game that I know of is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392070-ooc-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-campaign-set-in-2009\">this one</a> (btw, I am a player).</div> </div> </div> </div>... And considering we all had a reasonable time to get somewhat familiar with MtA 2nd Edition, I'm here,,, desperately looking for an online game.<br /> <br /> I'm from Brazil, which narrows my possibilities of a presential game. Besides, my closer friends don't have much interest on the game rules or got the needed english proficiency to read and catch these same rules.<br /> <br /> I really hope somebody shows up. It could be so nice!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2255-fitch","name":"Fitch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2255_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T09:24:09-07:00","id":962325,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"htt